New games: Connect Four, Mastermind, Battleship, Letterfall, Klotski, Yacht, Shut the Box, Ten Thousand and Ship, Captain, Crew. Chess, checkers, Go, Mahjong, Towers and the dice now use real 3D pieces you can view from any angle, and matched Mahjong tiles lift out in a burst of sparkles. Chess and Go have their full endings. Many boards now fit a phone screen better.
